{
  "_doc": "Semantic aliases (02 \u00a72). Values are dotted refs into primitives.json. Names never reference hue, so a re-skin is a value swap \u2014 the Infisical port changed every value here and not one token name. DARK IS NOW THE PORTAL'S LIVE THEME (Infisical is dark-only); the light map is retained because emails, print receipts and the Ops admin layer render on paper, and because the contrast gate asserts both.",
